@startuml
!include ../../themes/proveo.puml
title StarChess authorized economic boundaries — local R3 library
left to right direction

node "Trusted session binding\nr3Session.ts" as Session <<host>>
component "Native companion\nfull private state" as Native <<host>>
component "r3Projection.ts\nrecipient authorization" as Projection <<app>>
component "authorized/v2\nclosed schema + canonical bytes" as Schemas <<app>>
component "reconcileBoundary\nidentity / receipts / mines / memory" as Reducer <<app>>
database "Staged successor\ninitial / turn-open / settled" as Staged <<db>>
component "Independent parent reexecution\nprivate bytes + native result\nboth recipient batches" as Verify <<host>>
database "Committed recipient boundary\nadvanceHistory" as History <<db>>
component "packages/starchess-training/src/candidates.ts\ncomposeCandidatesFromHistoryV2" as Candidates <<app>>
component "Rejected transition\nprior authority retained" as Rejected <<error>>

Session ARROW_MAIN Native : initialize / Begin / admitted End
Native ARROW_MAIN Projection : committed frames + consumed proofs
Projection ARROW_MAIN Schemas : public recipient facts only
Schemas ARROW_MAIN Reducer : detached validated batch
Reducer ARROW_MAIN Staged : paid conservation + final agreement
Staged ARROW_MAIN Verify : claim detached before comparison
Session ARROW_MAIN Verify : independent prior session
Verify ARROW_MAIN History : recheck freshness and commit
History ARROW_OPTIONAL Candidates : AuthorizedHistory only\ncaller invokes the pure entry
Verify ARROW_ERROR Rejected : mismatch / stale / malformed
Reducer ARROW_ERROR Rejected : sequence / conservation failure

note bottom of Projection
  Geometric vision uses committed images.
  Consumed facts authorize the acting target.
  Casualty memory clears before later deltas.
end note
note bottom of Reducer
  Mine quantity differs from unique locations.
  Settlement income is final, including zero.
end note
note bottom of Verify
  Private bytes cap: 16 MiB.
  Public batch cap: 1 MiB.
  JSON validation grants no session authority.
end note
